        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "This is a bug in annotation generation.\n\nCython/Compiler/Annotate.py:120 attempts to open the virtual file _cyutility.pyx that is not created in v3.2.6+.\n\nTo workaround  in setup.py, just touch the missing file:\n\n```diff\n if sharedCythonModule:\n     extensions = [Extension(\"_cyutility\",\n                             extra_link_args=extra_link_args,\n                             sources=[\"_cyutility.c\"])]\n+    try:\n+        with open('build/_cyutility.pyx', 'w'):\n+            pass\n+    except FileNotFoundError:\n+        pass\n else:\n     extensions = []\n```\n",
